# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reverse-engineering scratch space
#   work/ holds charts, decompiled functions, Ghidra projects and test logs.
#   It is derived from the user's own copy of the game and is not needed to
#   build or run the port.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
work/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored / downloaded third-party toolchain
#   Ghidra is ~1.1 GB. Install it here only when doing RE work; see README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/third_party/
#   Android SDK/NDK, Gradle, its caches and the SDL sources (~4 GB); fetched by
#   `make -C android toolchain`.
android/third_party/
android/.gradle/
android/app/.cxx/
android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

